text = "To obtain a Chopped ingredient:
1. Interact with the chopping board (left mouse click) while holding the unchopped ingredient in your hand.
2. Repeatedly right-click until the bar is full.
3. Left-click to retrieve the chopped ingredient from the board.

To start cooking a dish, you must place all required ingredients in the pot, then interact with the stove."
